  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="76.1a">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IICn">II Cn</ref> 76.1a</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Ac ðara cægan heo sceal weardian, þæt is hire heddernes cæge ⁊ hyre cyste cæge [⁊ hire tægen]; gyf hit under ðyssa ænigum gebroht byð, ðone bið heo scyldig.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">But it is her duty to guard the keys of the following—her storeroom and her chest and her cupboard. If the goods have been put in any of these, she shall be held guilty.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Ac þære cægean heo sceal weardian, þæt is hyre hordern ⁊ hyre cyste ⁊ hyre tege: gif hit under þyssa ænigum gebroht byð, þonne byð heo scyldig.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
